        <div style="width: 65%;">
            <div class="section-heading">Research Services News: Staff Changes and New RA Roles</div>
            <p style="font-size: 10pt; line-height: 1.5;">The FY2011 fringe benefit rates have been set and will be effective as of 7/1/10. The new rates are:</p>
            <ul style="font-size: 10pt; padding-left: 20px;">
                <li>FT Faculty: 23.6%</li>
                <li>FT Staff: 24.4%</li>
                <li>PT Faculty or staff: 7.5%</li>
                <li>Grad Students: 41.7% (32.2% for tuition and 9.5% for health)</li>
            </ul>
            <p style="font-size: 10pt; line-height: 1.5;">The research compliance staff wishes the best of luck to <span data-field="full_name">{{ full_name }}</span> as she graduates and leaves her compliance assistant position. Jennifer Smith, a PhD student in Applied Social Psychol-ogy, will be joining the office this sum-mer.</p>
