            <p style="font-size: 10pt; line-height: 1.5;">The Gannon Center for Women and Leadership co-sponsored the conference, "Women in Russia: Politics and Policy, with the Kigali Chair in Political Science, the College of Arts and Sciences and the Graduate School on May 3. The Center is also sponsoring an immersion trip to Kenya to visit women's businesses in May.</p>
